      "writtenOn": "2025-10-22T12:22:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wanted to focus on `vpx_codec_decode`...\n\nShould we call `vpx_codec_destroy(\u0026codec);` if `vpx_codec_dec_init(\u0026codec, ...` fails ?",
      "parentUuid": "35a2e1f0_e00ccf5b",
      "revId": "d07b3526a8e0bedc2e5d742e2341fb4af928003a",
